## 4) oo_meta_epoch stability harness — PASS

Tiny C main linked against umbrella `runtime/chs_rt.c`:

```
gcc -O2 -Iruntime -Wall -Wextra \
  -o $TMPDIR/meta_epoch_harness \
  $TMPDIR/meta_epoch_harness.c runtime/chs_rt.c \
  -lpthread -ldl -lm
