Run 2 (new process — different epoch, each pair stable):
```
epoch_a=7961479276808888778
epoch_b=7961479276808888778
OK meta_epoch stable
```

Evidence paths:
- harness src: `/home/jeryd/.cache/ooda-tmp/meta_epoch_harness.c` (21 lines)
